# Narset, Parter of Veils ({1}{U}{U}, paid with an Island and two Moxen) on turn 1. Her -2 looks at the top four cards:
# Brainstorm, Ornithopter and two Plains. Only Brainstorm is a noncreature, nonland card, so only it may go to the hand;
# the rest go to the bottom. On turn 2 Bot2 draws for the turn, then casts its own Brainstorm: it may not draw a second
# card this turn, so it draws none, then puts back two cards.

